  subscheme: indnumb → pullback f Z.subscheme i
  condset : ok
  mor: pullbackmor
  cov: affine refinement oof pullback X.affineCover
  ideal:   indnumb → cov.index → pullback ideal A γ (not trivial  but can provide very elementary argument )
